  "display_title": "One-in-Seven-Billion Irregular",
  "description": "Joo Seungho’s ability to hyper-focus makes him a god in virtual reality games, until the day his brain becomes overloaded and he falls into a coma. Forbidden from playing VR games, he can only watch as the most hotly anticipated new RPG comes online. But when a new technology gives him a second chance to play, Seungho dares to return to the world of VR. In this ever-changing environment, can Seungho use his gift to stay one step ahead of the other players without putting himself back at risk? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 20 side stories.*",
